WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.367 --> 00:00:02.802
-Welcome back.
We're here with Chrissy Teigen,

00:00:02.802 --> 00:00:05.071
and we're about to play a game
called "Best, Worst, First."

00:00:05.071 --> 00:00:05.972
Here we go.

00:00:05.972 --> 00:00:06.973
-♪ Unh, let me hear your ♪

00:00:06.973 --> 00:00:10.309
-♪ Best, worst, first ♪

00:00:10.309 --> 00:00:11.644
-Alright, now,
here's how it works.

00:00:11.644 --> 00:00:13.312
I'm gonna hit this button,
which will activate

00:00:13.312 --> 00:00:15.147
a random topic generator.

00:00:15.147 --> 00:00:18.117
It'll land on a random prompt,
like best pickup line

00:00:18.117 --> 00:00:20.687
you've ever used
or worst lie you ever told.

00:00:20.687 --> 00:00:23.189
Whatever it lands on,
you have to say the first thing

00:00:23.189 --> 00:00:24.523
that comes to your mind.

00:00:24.523 --> 00:00:26.526
Are you ready?
-Okay. Ready.

00:00:26.526 --> 00:00:29.528
-Here we go.
First up is "Best."

00:00:29.528 --> 00:00:30.863 line:0%
[ Digital tones playing ]

00:00:30.863 --> 00:00:32.399 line:0%
Best...

00:00:34.366 --> 00:00:37.537 line:0%
Best celebrity encounter.

00:00:37.537 --> 00:00:38.872 line:0%
-Oh, God.

00:00:38.872 --> 00:00:40.707 line:0%
Um... [ Laughs ]

00:00:40.707 --> 00:00:44.210 line:0%
God, I think it was after
the Golden Globes...

00:00:44.210 --> 00:00:46.379 line:0%
[ Laughing ] Oh, no.
This might be "worst."

00:00:46.379 --> 00:00:48.314 line:0%
I was drinking a lot

00:00:48.314 --> 00:00:52.485 line:0%
and I saw somebody
at the entrance

00:00:52.485 --> 00:00:54.153 line:0%
holding a glass of champagne,

00:00:54.153 --> 00:00:56.388 line:0%
so I just went up and I took it
and I said thank you,

00:00:56.388 --> 00:00:58.558 line:0%
and then John goes,
"That was Michael Keaton."

00:00:58.558 --> 00:01:00.393 line:0%
[ Both laugh ]

00:01:00.393 --> 00:01:02.228 line:0%
It was not...

00:01:02.228 --> 00:01:05.064 line:0%
-It was not someone
serving champagne?

00:01:05.064 --> 00:01:08.567 line:0%
-No, it was not.

00:01:08.567 --> 00:01:10.402 line:0%
And I'm so embarrassed by it
still.

00:01:10.402 --> 00:01:11.738 line:0%
-Oh, my...
-I could die.

00:01:11.738 --> 00:01:13.206 line:0%
-Well, at least
it's Michael Keaton.

00:01:13.206 --> 00:01:15.207 line:0%
He'll be a good sport about it.
He'll be funny and be like,

00:01:15.207 --> 00:01:16.709 line:0%
"What was that all about?"

00:01:16.709 --> 00:01:19.045 line:0%
-But I just, I took it,
I drank it, and I left.

00:01:19.045 --> 00:01:21.047 line:0%
-I'll take that answer.
I love that story.

00:01:21.047 --> 00:01:24.050 line:0%
And it's a good person to do
that to 'cause he's funny.

00:01:24.050 --> 00:01:25.552 line:0%
Alright, here we go.

00:01:25.552 --> 00:01:26.552 line:0%
Next round.

00:01:26.552 --> 00:01:28.755 line:0%
It is time for "Worst."

00:01:28.755 --> 00:01:30.255 line:0%
Here we go.

00:01:30.255 --> 00:01:31.590 line:0%
[ Digital tones playing ]

00:01:31.590 --> 00:01:32.959 line:0%
Worst...

00:01:35.128 --> 00:01:37.096 line:0%
Worst job you ever had.

00:01:37.096 --> 00:01:39.098 line:0%
The worst job you ever had.

00:01:39.098 --> 00:01:41.768 line:0%
-Um...I don't know...

00:01:41.768 --> 00:01:43.970 line:0%
if it necessarily had been
the worst,

00:01:43.970 --> 00:01:47.439 line:0%
but I had a job at
a color-changing T-shirt shop.

00:01:47.439 --> 00:01:50.276 line:0%
And I'd have to stand outside
and lure people inside

00:01:50.276 --> 00:01:51.977 line:0%
and say like, "Come check
this out! Check this out!

00:01:51.977 --> 00:01:53.446 line:0%
Check this out!
Check this T-shirt out!

00:01:53.446 --> 00:01:55.281 line:0%
This nail polish changes!"
And it was just, like,

00:01:55.281 --> 00:01:58.117 line:0%
outlined shirts
that I had to sell.

00:01:58.117 --> 00:02:03.622 line:0%
And, but the worst part was
that I actually quit my job

00:02:03.622 --> 00:02:05.124 line:0%
because I got this big --

00:02:05.124 --> 00:02:07.127 line:0%
Oh, yeah! This is the worst job!

00:02:07.127 --> 00:02:09.962 line:0%
I thought I had
this big opportunity

00:02:09.962 --> 00:02:12.799 line:0%
to be in a Red Bull commercial.

00:02:12.799 --> 00:02:14.834 line:0%
But it turns out they just
wanted me to be one of those

00:02:14.834 --> 00:02:17.870 line:0%
girls on the beach that wear,
like, the thick flip-flops

00:02:17.870 --> 00:02:19.872 line:0%
and give out Red Bulls.

00:02:19.872 --> 00:02:23.710 line:0%
So, I quit my entire job just
to give out free Red Bulls

00:02:23.710 --> 00:02:26.012 line:0%
during the U.S. Open of Surfing.

00:02:26.012 --> 00:02:28.348 line:0%
[ Laughs ] And I thought it was,
like, my big break.

00:02:28.348 --> 00:02:31.350 line:0%
I was like, "Finally,
I'm going to Hollywood!"

00:02:31.350 --> 00:02:33.519 line:0%
-I'm gonna be on
a commercial for --

00:02:33.519 --> 00:02:38.357 line:0%
Like, yeah, no, you're just
wearing big flip-flops.

00:02:38.357 --> 00:02:41.261 line:0%
-Remember those thick
flip-flops, the Rocket Dogs?

00:02:41.261 --> 00:02:43.763 line:0%
-Yep. Oh, my God.
-And they had studs on them.

00:02:43.763 --> 00:02:47.099 line:0%
And then I wore, like,
a schoolgirl black skirt

00:02:47.099 --> 00:02:49.268 line:0%
on the beach, and a bikini top,

00:02:49.268 --> 00:02:50.937 line:0%
giving out Red Bull.

00:02:50.937 --> 00:02:52.438 line:0%
Oh, my God.
-Hey, man.

00:02:52.438 --> 00:02:54.340 line:0%
Honestly, we all have
a story, right?

00:02:54.340 --> 00:02:56.509 line:0%
Oh, my gosh. I'm surprised we
didn't run into each other,

00:02:56.509 --> 00:02:58.344 line:0%
'cause I had the same job
that summer.

00:02:58.344 --> 00:03:01.014 line:0%
[ Both laugh ]

00:03:01.014 --> 00:03:02.181 line:0%
Okay.

00:03:02.181 --> 00:03:03.883 line:0%
-The skirt and all?
-Oh, yeah.

00:03:03.883 --> 00:03:05.218 line:0%
Everything, yeah, of course.

00:03:05.218 --> 00:03:06.886 line:0%
Last round. Here we go.

00:03:06.886 --> 00:03:09.388 line:0%
It is time for "First."

00:03:09.388 --> 00:03:11.723 line:0%
[ Digital tones playing ]
-Oh, God.

00:03:11.723 --> 00:03:13.893 line:0%
-Chrissy Teigen, first...

00:03:13.893 --> 00:03:15.895 line:0%
[ Gasps ] Oh, your first kiss.

00:03:15.895 --> 00:03:18.564 line:0%
Do you remember your first kiss?

00:03:18.564 --> 00:03:20.967 line:0%
-Oh, my God,
should I say his name?

00:03:20.967 --> 00:03:23.802 line:0%
Are people gonna try
to find him?

00:03:23.802 --> 00:03:26.972 line:0%
My first kiss was actually
at my -- after...

00:03:26.972 --> 00:03:29.475 line:0%
Oh, I went on a date
to Red Robin,

00:03:29.475 --> 00:03:31.810 line:0%
and it was, like,
the nice Red Robin.

00:03:31.810 --> 00:03:33.645 line:0%
We went, like, to the further
Red Robin.

00:03:33.645 --> 00:03:34.980 line:0%
-Yeah, yeah.
-[ Laughs ]

00:03:34.980 --> 00:03:37.817 line:0%
And then he dropped me off

00:03:37.817 --> 00:03:40.152 line:0%
at, actually, my best friend
Bonnie's house,

00:03:40.152 --> 00:03:43.289 line:0%
and she -- because her parents
were really cool,

00:03:43.289 --> 00:03:45.791 line:0%
and I don't think
I told my parents.

00:03:45.791 --> 00:03:48.794 line:0%
So, we went back there,
he walked me to the door,

00:03:48.794 --> 00:03:50.963 line:0%
and he was, like, a basketball
player at our school,

00:03:50.963 --> 00:03:53.599 line:0%
and it was just so...
He was not, like --

00:03:53.599 --> 00:03:55.601 line:0%
I don't know,
he was just such a nice guy.

00:03:55.601 --> 00:03:58.103 line:0%
-Did you feel it was coming that
you were gonna have a kiss?

00:03:58.103 --> 00:04:01.273 line:0%
-No, no, but I remember
how giddy I was after.

00:04:01.273 --> 00:04:02.441 line:0%
I was so excited.

00:04:02.441 --> 00:04:04.110 line:0%
And then nothing happened,
though, after.

00:04:04.110 --> 00:04:05.611 line:0%
Like, not a thing.

00:04:05.611 --> 00:04:06.879 line:0%
-Yeah.
-Not a -- Like, no --

00:04:06.879 --> 00:04:08.547 line:0%
Like, at school,
we didn't talk anymore.

00:04:08.547 --> 00:04:12.218 line:0%
[ Both laugh ]

00:04:12.218 --> 00:04:15.054 line:0%
-That's how you know it's
a first kiss, of course, right?

00:04:15.054 --> 00:04:17.723 line:0%
That's exactly what happens.
-We pretended nothing happened.

00:04:17.723 --> 00:04:19.391 line:0%
-Yeah, you don't even
say hi to each other.

00:04:19.391 --> 00:04:20.893 line:0%
That was over.
You had your moment.

00:04:20.893 --> 00:04:22.328 line:0%
That was it.
-[ Laughing ] I know.

00:04:22.328 --> 00:04:25.064 line:0%
-Pal, thank you for playing.
That was "Best, Worst, First."

